@MinimalGallery.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5259

GET {{MinimalGallery.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### One random long video without a recorded play, sampled across the entire library
GET {{MinimalGallery.API_HostAddress}}/users/tester/search?fileExtensions=mp4&minFileSize=104857600&unwatchedOnly=true&random=true&maxResults=1&allTagsMustMatch=false
Accept: application/json

### History is retained without a total cap; requests remain paginated
GET {{MinimalGallery.API_HostAddress}}/users/tester/watch-history?from=500&size=50
Accept: application/json
